  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WPS Focal Points Network</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The initiative will support the global network of Women, Peace and Security (WPS) Focal Points currently comprised of 103 UN Member States and regional organizations from all geographic regions, as well as UN entities and civil society partners. More specifically the project will support the Secretariate function and support to the Network during the co-chair period of Norway and Japan for 2025.</narrative>
  </description>
